  "text": "google_logo Play\nGames\nApps\nBooks\nChildren\nsearch\nhelp_outline\nEzOMR - OMR Scanner\nEzExam Technologies\n3.9\nstar\n43 reviews\n10K+\nDownloads\nInstall\nShare\nplay_arrow\nTrailer\nAbout this app\narrow_forward\nUse any of the over 20 OMRs provided at http://ezex.in/ezomrs to print on any paper and conduct exams. Then they can be scanned using the EzOMR App to instantly get Scores & Error reports.\n\nAll NEET & JEE Exam pattern OMRs are available, even with complex scoring like for the latest 2022 patterns.\n\nEzOMR enables you to instantly evaluate and give error reports while also using your own OMRs. If you want to use your own OMR, send your OMR's PDF to support@ezexam.in to get started.\n\nImprove your students' learning by instantly giving them Scores and their Corrected OMRs.\nIf you've created an account and would like to delete it, simply email support@ezexam.in with your details.\nInstantly Evaluate OMRs & Get Results!\nUpdated on\nOct 19, 2026\nEducation\nData safety\narrow_forward\nSafety starts with understanding how developers collect and share your data. Data privacy and security practices may vary based on your use, region, and age. The developer provided this information and may update it over time.\nNo data shared with third parties\nLearn more about how developers declare sharing\nThis app may collect these data types\nPersonal info, App activity and 2 others\nData is encrypted in transit\nYou can request that data be deleted\nSee details\nRatings and reviews\narrow_forward\nRatings and reviews are verified\ninfo_outline\nphone_android\nPhone\n3.9\n43 reviews\n5\n4\n3\n2\n1\nsahil kandari\nmore_vert\nDecember 2, 2022\nVery Easy to use. Just download the OMR sheets from Exams, Fill it up and scan it.\n4 people found this review helpful\nDid you find this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nJoy John\nmore_vert\nMarch 20, 2024\nNot Working Every time I am trying to Create a Test it is Automatically Crashing ..... Please Fix this Asap, Thank You\n3 people found this review helpful\nDid you find this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nAman Rawat\nmore_vert\nDecember 2, 2022\nGreat app helps a lot Amazing work 👍\nDid you find this helpful?\nYes\nNo\nSee all reviews\nflag\nFlag as inappropriate\nRated for 3+\nLearn more\nApp support\nexpand_more\nGoogle Play\n\nPlay Pass\n\nPlay Points\n\nGift cards\n\nRedeem\n\nRefund policy\n\nChildren and family\n\nParent guide\n\nFamily sharing\n\nTerms of Service\n\nPrivacy\n\nAbout Google Play\n\nDevelopers\n\nGoogle Store\n\nAll prices include GST.\nIndia (English (India))"
